values
  ('c92cb193-bf36-5dd4-b096-6c3495381c1d', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g10-figurative-language'), null, 'medium',
   $q$By evening, "middle C answered right away." What does the word "answered" suggest about the repaired piano?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Luis asked his father a question and got an answer right away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-target"},{"text":"The piano could now play a song by itself without anyone touching it.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"The piano now responds to Luis immediately, almost like a partner in conversation.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The note still sounded late but was much louder than before.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The piano now responds to Luis immediately, almost like a partner in conversation.$q$, $q$"Answered" personifies the note and contrasts with the earlier delay, showing the sound now comes "right away." The phrase describes the piano's response to a key press, not a conversation between people.$q$, 'draft', '55e04f37-dcb7-5914-9a5b-d7401c418c67')
