  ('a5a2704b-7b17-51a8-983d-934fb0758f04', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g10-figurative-language'), null, 'easy',
   $q$According to the passage, a cat listed as "independent" most likely:$q$, $q$[{"text":"is the most affectionate cat at the shelter.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"lives outdoors and does not need a home.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"has already been adopted by another family.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"does not enjoy being held by people.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$does not enjoy being held by people.$q$, $q$The passage translates the kennel card euphemism directly: a cat listed as "independent" "did not enjoy being held." Calling it the most affectionate cat reverses that meaning.$q$, 'draft', '2e36ce9a-2dca-5cff-a90b-752aeb4ce2be')
